      "physical_description": null,
      "summary": "(Register slip)\r\nLarge neatly made bow; wood with strip of whalebone along each face, the edges rimmed with ivory; the front face  and edges and middle of the back are covered with fine birch bark covered with impressed lines; extreme ends and middle bound with  leather thong; twisted leather thong cord looped over the notched ends; the middle of hte bow is contracted, underneath the bend of each end is a knob to catch the string; the arms of the bow are flat but the ends are flattened out in oppoiste directions. Length 5ft 2.5 ins; width 1.75 ins.\r\n(with a case, As.4472.b)",
